      "description": "Media-first library row; sample inline artwork only stands in for preview content.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-preset\"><svg class=\"ds-thumb\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 180\" aria-label=\"Sample timeline preview\" role=\"img\"><rect width=\"320\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#11151a\"/><path d=\"M20 135H300M60 125v20M230 125v20\" stroke=\"#d9b473\"/><rect x=\"95\" y=\"25\" width=\"130\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#27313d\"/><path d=\"M110 95l35-45 25 30 15-12 25 27\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a6afbd\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-info\"><strong>The space age</strong><small>Photo journey</small><span class=\"ds-description\">Large images along a continuous chronology.</span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-preset{display:block;text-align:left;width:240px;min-width:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #383f4b;border-radius:6px;background:#14171c;box-shadow:none;color:var(--text,#edf0f4);font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .16s,border-color .16s}.ds-thumb{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9}.ds-info{display:block;padding:10px 11px 11px}.ds-info strong{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}.ds-info small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#b0bac8;margin-top:3px}.ds-description{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:#a1adbe;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5}.ds-preset:hover{background:#2a303a;border-color:#616b7c}.ds-preset:active{background:#323a46}.ds-preset:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber,#efb54d);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-preset[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#dfa64a;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #dfa64a25} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){[class^=\"ds-\"]{transition:none!important}}"
